{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 48, :comments ["<b>All the food.</b> The meaning is not literally \"all,\" for they were dying of starvation. So too, \"and all the earth came\" (Genesis 41:57) — rather, its sense is that he gathered all that he could."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 41, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:47:45.451094087Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}